    <briefdescription>
<para>Dimensionally unsplit, second-order predictor/corrector for conservative systems. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Piecewise-linear reconstruction follows the MUSCL lineage of <ref refid="bibliography_1ref_vanleer1979" kindref="member">van Leer (1979)</ref>. Face states are predicted by half of the full multidimensional flux divergence, then a shared face flux updates cells. The System adapter supplies states, fluxes, admissibility, and unit conversions. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
